alpha2/llmisvc/controller.go:419, pkg/controller/v1alpha1/localmodel/reconcilers/localmodelcache_reconciler.go:340]\n634\t- **Metrics and observability:** Controller manager metrics are exposed on localhost:8080 and proxied through kube-rbac-proxy (or odh-kube-auth-proxy in ODH/RHOAI) on port 8443 with TLS termination. Prometheus scrapes this endpoint via service annotations. The LLMISVC controller creates ServiceMonitor and PodMonitor resources for prometheus-operator integration. The queue-proxy extension (qpext) exposes a /metrics endpoint for per-pod inference metrics. [source: config/default/manager_auth_proxy_patch.yaml:22, config/rbac/auth_proxy_service.yaml:1, qpext/cmd/qpext/main.go:323]\n635\t- **Admission and validation:** All CRD mutations pass through webhook admission: mutating webhooks apply defaults to InferenceService and LLMInferenceService resources, while validating webhooks enforce schema constraints. A pod mutator webhook injects sidecar containers into inference pods. The LLMISVC webhook service also handles CRD conversion between v1alpha1 and v1alpha2 API versions. [source: config/webhook/manifests.yaml:2, config/webhook/llmisvc/manifests.yaml:1, pkg/webhook/admission/pod/mutator.go:36]\n636\t\n637\t## Integration Points\n638\t\n639\t- **/v1/ConfigMap:** Controller watch (Owns); protocol: Kubernetes API; purpose: KserveModuleReconciler. [source: cmd/router/main.go:525, 529, 583, 614, 646, 675, config/default/manager_resources_patch.yaml:1, config/manager/service.yaml:1, config/rbac/auth_proxy_service.yaml:1]\n640\t- **/v1/ConfigMap:** Controller watch (Watches); protocol: Kubernetes API; purpose: KserveModuleReconciler. [source: cmd/router/main.go:525, 529, 583, 614, 646, 675, config/default/manager_resources_patch.yaml:1, config/manager/service.yaml:1, config/rbac/auth_proxy_service.yaml:1]\n641\t- **/v1/ConfigMap:** Controller watch (Watches); protocol: Kubernetes API; purpose: LLMISVCReconciler. [source: cmd/router/main.go:525, 529, 583, 6